visibility in direct sunlight. Remote content management with 4G/5G connectivity. Designed for 10+ year continuous outdoor operation.\", \"sku\": \"BL-ART-UC6\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/urbancanvas-p6-outdoor\", \"category\": \"art-immersive\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_urbancanvas-p6-outdoor.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 500, \"highPrice\": 10000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/urbancanvas-p6-outdoor\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"6mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"8000 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What makes the UrbanCanvas P6 Outdoor suitable for large-scale public art installations?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The UrbanCanvas P6 Outdoor features a 6mm pixel pitch and high brightness of 8000 nits, ensuring vivid, detailed images visible even in direct sunlight. Its IP65 rating and anti-corrosion treatment make it durable for outdoor urban environments, including coastal areas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How is the UrbanCanvas P6 Outdoor powered and controlled remotely?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This LED canvas supports 4G and 5G remote connectivity, allowing seamless content management and updates from any location. This remote control ability is ideal for managing dynamic public art without on-site intervention.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the expected lifespan of the UrbanCanvas P6 Outdoor?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The product is designed for long-term use with an estimated lifespan of 100,000 hours, making it suitable for continuous operation over 10 years in outdoor environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the IP rating and why does it matter for outdoor installations?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The UrbanCanvas P6 Outdoor is rated IP65, meaning it is fully protected against dust and low-pressure water jets from any direction. This rating ensures the display can withstand harsh weather conditions including rain and dust.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the UrbanCanvas P6 Outdoor compare to other outdoor LED displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Compared to alternatives, UrbanCanvas P6 offers superior brightness at 8000 nits and an industry-standard 6mm pixel pitch optimized for clarity in large-scale art. Its robust IP65 rating and anti-corrosion treatment also give it an edge in coastal and harsh outdoor environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty options are available for the UrbanCanvas P6 Outdoor?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Warranty terms vary, but Brightluxx typically offers a comprehensive 3-5 year warranty covering manufacturing defects and performance issues. Extended warranties and maintenance packages can also be requested.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the UrbanCanvas P6 Outdoor be integrated into building facades?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, this product is designed specifically for integration into building facades and urban landmarks due to its slim profile, weatherproof technology, and high brightness, making it perfect for visually impactful architectural installations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of environments is the UrbanCanvas P6 Outdoor optimized for?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It is optimized for outdoor urban environments, including plazas, coastal areas, and high-traffic public spaces, where weather resistance, brightness, and remote content management are essential.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"UrbanCanvas P6 Outdoor\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/urbancanvas-p6-outdoor\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>UrbanCanvas P6 Outdoor</h1><p>Get UrbanCanvas P6 Outdoor LED displays for vivid visuals in Dubai. Contact Brightluxx UAE for high-quality outdoor LED display solutions.</p><p><strong>Weatherproof LED canvas for large-scale public art installations.</strong></p><p>Industrial-grade outdoor LED display designed for permanent public art installations. IP65 rated with anti-corrosion treatment for coastal environments. Brightness up to 8000 nits ensures visibility in direct sunlight. Remote content management with 4G/5G connectivity. Designed for 10+ year continuous outdoor operation.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What makes the UrbanCanvas P6 Outdoor suitable for large-scale public art installations?</h3><p>The UrbanCanvas P6 Outdoor features a 6mm pixel pitch and high brightness of 8000 nits, ensuring vivid, detailed images visible even in direct sunlight. Its IP65 rating and anti-corrosion treatment make it durable for outdoor urban environments, including coastal areas.</p><h3>How is the UrbanCanvas P6 Outdoor powered and controlled remotely?</h3><p>This LED canvas supports 4G and 5G remote connectivity, allowing seamless content management and updates from any location. This remote control ability is ideal for managing dynamic public art without on-site intervention.</p><h3>What is the expected lifespan of the UrbanCanvas P6 Outdoor?</h3><p>The product is designed for long-term use with an estimated lifespan of 100,000 hours, making it suitable for continuous operation over 10 years in outdoor environments.</p><h3>What is the IP rating and why does it matter for outdoor installations?</h3><p>The UrbanCanvas P6 Outdoor is rated IP65, meaning it is fully protected against dust and low-pressure water jets from any direction. This rating ensures the display can withstand harsh weather conditions including rain and dust.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n7:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\na:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\nc:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n9:X\\n0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"products\\\",\\\"urbancanvas-p6-outdoor\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"slug\\\",\\\"products/urbancanvas-p6-outdoor\\\",\\\"c\\\",[\\\"products\\\"]],{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$u