nCanvas P6 Outdoor suitable for large-scale public art installations?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe UrbanCanvas P6 Outdoor features a 6mm pixel pitch and high brightness of 8000 nits, ensuring vivid, detailed images visible even in direct sunlight. Its IP65 rating and anti-corrosion treatment make it durable for outdoor urban environments, including coastal areas.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow is the UrbanCanvas P6 Outdoor powered and controlled remotely?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis LED canvas supports 4G and 5G remote connectivity, allowing seamless content management and updates from any location. This remote control ability is ideal for managing dynamic public art without on-site intervention.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is the expected lifespan of the UrbanCanvas P6 Outdoor?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe product is designed for long-term use with an estimated lifespan of 100,000 hours, making it suitable for continuous operation over 10 years in outdoor environments.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is the IP rating and why does it matter for outdoor installations?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe UrbanCanvas P6 Outdoor is rated IP65, meaning it is fully protected against dust and low-pressure water jets from any direction. This rating ensures the display can withstand harsh weather conditions including rain and dust.\\u003c/p\\u003e14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$15\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n8:null\\nd:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"UrbanCanvas P6 Outdoor LED Display - Dubai LED Solutions | Brightluxx\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Get UrbanCanvas P6 Outdoor LED displays for vivid visuals in Dubai. Contact